''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <b>Imhotep</b> (Netjer) and <b>Heracles </b>(Theoi) are orginal Keepers.<br /> <b>Eris </b>(Theoi), Goddess of Strife, was recruted by Hercales. She joined to see World 'burn in discord' ( her domain ), but was not full on the destroying it part. Now she is somehow possible to lead PCs to overthrow Keepers, or to destroy them from inside.<br /> <b>Hecate</b> (Theoi), Goddess of Crossroads - is at crossroads. She is neutral, at the start. She maybe is with Keepers conspiracy, but she also want to make sure they are doing right thing. If PCs will side with Keepers, she is planted as opposing force to them inside.<br /> <b>Tlaz\u014dlte\u014dtl </b>(Te\u014dtl) She of the Black Lips, She Who Eats Sin and Excrement, is finally going to drown The World in its own sin and filth until she darkens the Sun. And then all of Keepers will remake World, when <b>Tlaz\u014dlte\u014dtl</b> will plead Primordials for forgiveness and reset of reality.<br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> New gods described inside book are <b>Eris</b> ( a.k.a Discordia, Theoi ) and <b>Blodeuwedd</b> (Plant Don - those are Welsh gods? \ud83e\udd14) - It will be funny to tell stories about <i><b>Discord</b>ia </i>on our <b>Discord</b> server. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 06-21-2024, 01:22 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-20T08:54:45-07:00","id":1537708,"title":"","content":"Maybe stick that in spoilers Wyrd as a courtesy to others perhaps?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-20T13:02:38-07:00","id":1537724,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1537648-no-gods-no-masters-on-dtrpg?p=1537708#post1537708\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Maybe stick that in spoilers Wyrd as a courtesy to others perhaps?</div> </div> </div> </div>What do you want to talk here if 95% of this book should be under SPOILER tag? <b>No Gods. No Masters</b> is chronicle book - we should talk about adventures inside it freely ( cause it's majority of book ), not putting most of posts in SPOILER. ( I just ask on general rules for this topic. )","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-21T04:58:07-07:00","id":1537750,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">I\u2019m reading now <b>Armageddon Jam </b>adventure \u2013 preVisitation first story \u2013 and I\u2019m wondering about setting of chronicle. \u2018Some anglophone small city\u2019 is totally fine for me. I\u2019m more wondering about Evidence Dial in setting - <b>A</b><b>rmageddon Jam</b> is written like it\u2019s on Heroic (2) Evidance Dial ( See <b>Mysteries of the World \u2013 Scion Companion</b> book ) \u2013 things about Fate, Myths and Legend are generally pointed as \u2018ghost stories\u2019, but some people in the World are attuned to them and \u2018feel\u2019 they can be true \u2013 having some premonitions - however, it\u2019s margin of society. It\u2019s cool for me, as I like very much \u2018hack\u2019 of main Scion setting, like <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1275725-2e-setting-hack-gods-in-hiding-and-new-mythic-age\"><i><b>Gods in Hiding</b></i></a>. This chronicle maybe run a bit more direct like with attitude that, and still I think I like that to run as written.</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 06-21-2024, 12:48 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-21T08:02:45-07:00","id":1537751,"title":"","content":"Personally, I would prefer to turn the Evidence dial up as much as possible for this chronicle in particular, in order to amplify the potential consequences: in particular, if the Keepers of the World succeed, the result will either be \u201cthe World becomes <i>our</i> world, where gods don't exist at all and everything runs strictly according to the natural laws of reality\u201d or (more likely, thankfully) a turning of the Evidence dial all the way down to the minimum. It's more dramatic if it goes from \u201cnobody doubts that the gods exist, because they walk openly among us\u201d to \u201cit's easy to doubt the existence of the gods, because they're hidden away in realms that most people aren't even aware of, and operate almost entirely through agents who themselves tend to hide their divine characteristics and connections\u201d.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}